# VENUS E

> VENUS E is the German-market website for MARSTEK VENUS E solar energy storage solutions. The website provides official product information, technical explanations, application guides, product comparisons, customer support and educational content for residential solar energy storage.

VENUS E primarily serves the German market. The main website language is German (de-DE).

## Brand and Products

VENUS E offers solar energy storage solutions for different household energy requirements.

Product families include:
- VENUS E Mini
- VENUS E 3.0
- VENUS E 4.0
- VENUS E Max
- Smart Meter CT002
- Smart Meter CT003

For current specifications, compatibility, availability and pricing, always refer to the official product pages and product comparison.

- [VENUS E Official Website](https://venuse.de/)
- [VENUS E Modelle im Überblick](https://venuse.de/pages/speicher-vergleich)

